This is what we do[ at] Advivo and business growth will be the subject of our May event. It is our motivation[ for] helping people achieve their business goals and drive success. I will, of[ course,] be in attendance at our “Speed Dating With The Business Experts” to talk about these workshops and much more, so[ register] here, come along, say hi, have a glass of wine and see how we can help you!
